z vom 30. August bis 1. September 2026 in Lübeck","link":"https://www.bundestag.de/presse/pressemitteilungen/2026/pm-260825-baltic-sea-parliamentary-conference-1205778","desc":"Eine Delegation des Deutschen Bundestages nimmt vom 30. August bis 1. September 2026 an der 35. Jahrestagung der Ostseeparlamentarierkonferenz in Lübeck teil. Sie besteht aus den Abgeordneten Johannes Schraps (SPD, Ltg.), Georg Günther, Sebastian Schmidt (beide CDU/CSU), Gereon Bollmann (AfD) und Luise Amtsberg (BÜNDNIS 90/DIE GRÜNEN). Bundesaußenminister Johann Wadephul ist einer der Ehrengäste der Tagung. Das Thema der Baltic Sea Parliamentary Conference unter der Präsidentschaft des Schleswig-Holsteinischen Landtages lautet „Youth. Set. Sail. – For a thriving Baltic Sea Region“. Abgeordnete","date":"2026-08-25T05:59:07+00:00","topics":["plenum"],"boost":0,"priority":"","cats":[],"image":"","author":"","cat":"bt-allg","kind":"press","inst":"bundestag","cluster":1},{"id":"9630ebb05639","source":"BGH Entscheidungen","title":"6 StR 189/25, Entscheidung vom 04.03.2026","link":"https://www.bundesgerichtshof.de/SharedDocs/Entscheidungen/DE/Strafsenate/6_StS/2025/6_StR_189-25.html","desc":"Leitsatzentscheidung","date":"2026-08-25T00:00:00+00:00","topics":[],"boost":0,"priority":"","cats":[],"image":"","author":"","cat":"bgh","kind":"press","inst":"bgh","cluster":1},{"id":"a0f90dd0c3d3","source":"BGH Entscheidungen","title":"6 StR 8/26, Entscheidung vom 07.07.2026","link":"https://www.bundesgerichtshof.de/SharedDocs/Entscheidungen/DE/Strafsenate/6_StS/2026/6_StR___8-26.html","desc":"","date":"2026-08-25T00:00:00+00:00","topics":[],"boost":0,"priority":"","cats":[],"image":"","author":"","cat":"bgh","kind":"press","inst":"bgh","cluster":1},{"id":"eb3a8bbf9850","source":"BGH Entscheidungen","title":"5 StR 397/25, Entscheidung vom 30.07.2026","link":"https://www.bundesgerichtshof.de/SharedDocs/Entscheidungen/DE/Strafsenate/5_StS/2025/5_StR_397-25.html","desc":"","date":"2026-08-25T00:00:00+00:00","top